            "review_title": "Review at Mạch Saigon Gastropub",
            "review_text": "S B\nMedellin, Colombia15 contributions\n0\nMach No 1\nJan 2026 • Friends\nFrom finding the side street (easy due to the street sign) to being shown in by the security guard it was clear that it was a welcoming place. People say a place is good if the locals frequent it and this is now exception. I was shown to the bar since I was alone and provided with menus. Service is efficient but unobtrusive. \nIt’s regarded as a gastric and the selection of beers is good. I had an amber beer under the title cocktail beers (not really sure why that is). It was full of flavour. \nFood choice is wide and includes a range of delicious kebab style dishes. For those who like seafood and fish this place Cator’s well on that front too. \nDefinitely a worthy choice.\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
