            "review_text": "Tien\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nSo much fun & delicious\nJul 2025 • Friends\nHit up Mạch on a night they had an event goin’ on — super fun vibe, packed but still chill. The fusion food was so good, like creative but totally hit the spot. Honestly one of the best spots to drink and eat in Saigon for me. 100% recommend!\nInsider tip:\nBetter to book ahead! The place gets pretty packed, especially on event nights, so I’d definitely recommend booking a table in advance.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 28, 2025",
